      "name": "Borrowed Time",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/magic/time/hourglass-brown-orange.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Mother Sallow has taken part of Edric's remaining lifespan as collateral.</p><ul><li>Edric has Disadvantage on Strength and Dexterity checks and saving throws.</li><li>His Speed is 10 feet.</li><li>He cannot regain hit points above 12.</li><li>He cannot take Reactions and may take either an Action or a Bonus Action on his turn, not both.</li><li>The condition ends when all three Memory Bundles open or Mother Sallow dies.</li></ul>",
          "chat": ""
        },
